// Billed log ingest (raw bytes sent, before enrichment), by day.
// DPS documents the metric as builtin:billing.log.ingest.usage; its Grail
// timeseries name below is an assumption - confirm it in the metrics
// browser (phase-0 item). Compare with ghlog2dt.bytes from the heartbeat.
timeseries bytes = sum(dt.billing.log.ingest.usage), interval: 1d, from: now() - 14d
